  helperId: first_combat_helper
  title: Defeating your first enemy
  bodyText: "There is lots to know about fighting enemies but right now its simple.
    As you get stronger you will equip better items, level up skills and gain abilities
    to defeat tougher foes. There are many different stats enemies will have which
    make them more difficult to defeat. Combat Power (or CP) shows how tough these
    emeies are and is a combination of their offence, defence and sustain. \n\nYou
    can still defeat enemies without anything equipped, but you will be much weaker.\n\n\n"
